  "title": "Recursive Policy with Revocation-Aware Trust",
  "description": "Demonstrates how a resolver evaluates a deeply nested policy that walks an issuer's chain AND honors revocation status at every node. Useful for trust frameworks where intermediate CAs lose authority mid-flight (e.g. compromised key, sunset period).",
  "policy": {
